#: settings/theisland.setting.php
msgid "Contact Header Extras"
msgstr ""

#: settings/theisland.setting.php
msgid ""
"When viewing a contact record, display key contact information under the "
"contact display name."
msgstr ""

#: settings/theisland.setting.php
msgid ""
"Example: {contact.address_primary.city}{, "
"}{contact.address_primary.state_province_id:abbr}"
msgstr ""

#: settings/theisland.setting.php
msgid ""
"It can be any valid contact token. It is also possible to generate custom "
"tokens using the SearchKit Tokens extension (this may impact performance)."
msgstr ""

#: settings/theisland.setting.php
msgid "Hide the WordPress menubar when in CiviCRM"
msgstr "De menubalk van WordPress in CiviCRM verbergen"

#: settings/theisland.setting.php
msgid ""
"When logged-in as an editor or administrator, the WordPress menubar can be a"
" bit of a distraction. It can still be displayed again by clicking on the "
"CiviCRM logo in the top menu, then clicking on \"Hide the menu\"."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer je bent ingelogd als bewerker of beheerder, kan de WordPress-"
"menubalk wat storend zijn. Het menu kan nog steeds worden weergegeven door "
"op het CiviCRM-logo in het bovenste menu te klikken en vervolgens op \"Menu "
"verbergen\" te klikken."
